<section class="section bg-white" aria-labelledby="problems-heading"><div class="wrap-narrow">
  <h2 id="problems-heading" class="h-section mb-3 text-center">Sound familiar?</h2>
  <p class="lede mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center">These are the problems we look for on local business websites, and what each one can cost you.</p>
  <ul class="tile-grid">
    <li class="problem-tile"><h3>Your site is tiny on phones.</h3><p>Customers have to pinch and zoom to read it, so they back out and call someone else.</p></li>
    <li class="problem-tile"><h3>Chrome says “Not secure.”</h3><p>Visitors see a warning next to your name, and some leave before they read a word.</p></li>
    <li class="problem-tile"><h3>There is no way to book online.</h3><p>A customer who wants an appointment at 9 p.m. has to wait until morning, and some will book with someone else.</p></li>
    <li class="problem-tile"><h3>It is slow to load.</h3><p>On a phone, people don't wait. A slow page loses some of them.</p></li>
    <li class="problem-tile"><h3>It is hard for people using screen readers.</h3><p>That can keep blind and low-vision customers from reading your site or booking.</p></li>
  </ul>
  <div class="mt-8 text-center"><p class="mb-4 text-lg text-gray-800">See one of these on your own site? We will show you.</p><a href="{{ site.writeupCta.href }}" class="btn-primary">Get my free website write-up</a></div>
</div></section>

<section class="section steps-section" aria-labelledby="how-heading"><div class="wrap">
