<section class="section price-section" aria-labelledby="packages-heading"><div class="wrap"><h2 id="packages-heading" class="h-section mb-3 text-center">What it costs, starting at</h2><p class="lede mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center">Most fixes are a one-time job. The monthly plan is optional. Every price is in writing before any work starts.</p>{% set showIds = ["tuneup", "sprint", "launch", "partner"] %}<ul class="price-grid list-none p-0">{% for package in packages.all %}{% if package.id in showIds %}<li class="price-card"><h3>{{ package.name }}</h3>{% if package.id == "tuneup" or package.id == "launch" %}<p class="price-start">Starting at</p>{% endif %}<p class="price-amount">{{ package.price | replace("From ", "") }}</p><p class="price-note">{{ package.priceNote }}</p><p class="price-desc">{{ package.tagline }}</p></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul><p class="mt-8 text-center"><a href="/pricing/" class="link">See every package and what each one includes</a></p></div></section>

